1784335973.488 RX Newhaven, Healer
1784335973.488 RX     This small, stark stone chamber is bereft of even the simple ornamentation,
1784335973.488 RX and its bare walls gleam in the bright light of the torches lining its walls. A
1784335973.488 RX short, stocky man with a black beard sits behind a large stone table at the far
1784335973.488 RX end of the room. There is an iron washbasin and some simple, utilitarian items
1784335973.488 RX used in the healing profession lie at his side. You can exit the chamber to the
1784335973.488 RX east, where faint sounds of metal hitting metal can be heard. 
1784335973.489 RX You notice small sign here.
1784335973.509 RX Also here: healer.
1784335973.509 RX Obvious exits: east
