1784335989.538 RX Newhaven, Narrow Road
1784335989.538 RX     This narrow road is quite plain save for the various lanterns hanging from
1784335989.538 RX the trees around, and a large stone stairwell leading downwards. You hear the
1784335989.538 RX clash of steel below you, and cries of pain and triumph accompanying it. Stone
1784335989.538 RX buildings lie to your north and west. 
1784335989.538 RX Obvious exits: north, east, west, down
