1784335990.663 RX Newhaven, Narrow Path
1784335990.664 RX     This narrow path is fairly plain, save for the small lanterns hanging from
1784335990.664 RX the trees around. North of you lies a strangely decorated shop, and a beat-up
1784335990.664 RX shack labeled "General Store" lies to your south. The path leads east and west
1784335990.664 RX from here. 
1784335990.664 RX Obvious exits: north, south, east, west
