1784335992.910 RX Newhaven, Village Entrance
1784335992.910 RX     Welcome to Newhaven! You are standing at the crude wooden gates of the
1784335992.910 RX village entrance, in the middle of a dusty path. A low wooden palisade
1784335992.910 RX surrounds the village, to protect against creatures of the night and random
1784335992.910 RX raiders. You can see small buildings to the north and south, and a dusty path
1784335992.910 RX that leads to the west and southeast. 
1784335992.910 RX You notice large sign, newbie manual here.
1784335992.911 RX Obvious exits: north, south, west, southeast
1784335992.911 RX [HP=35]:Kaimon walks into the room from the west.
