1784335993.947 RX Newhaven, Forest Path
1784335993.947 RX     The trees become very thick around you now, and you can barely see where
1784335993.947 RX you're going due to the only light source being from the village behind you and
1784335993.947 RX the light shining through the trees. You hear the sound of rippling water south
1784335993.947 RX of here. 
1784335993.948 RX Obvious exits: south, northwest
1784335993.948 RX [HP=35]:Kaimon walks into the room from the northwest.
